From 4951a156b9a2fe142931ac980268c1193440c7c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Jhong <dylan@andestech.com>
Date: Tue, 9 Mar 2021 17:11:08 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 003/241] Andes AE350 RISC-V Machine

This provides a RISC-V Board based on Andes's AE350 specification.
The following machine is implemented:

- 'andes_ae350'; PLIC, PLICSW, PLMT, 16550a UART, VirtIO MMIO, device-tree

ref:
    117a2c61d7 andes_ae350: Fix AE350 inits two UARTs as duplicated character dev (#30)
    734b6a2557 hw/riscv: Reset L2 MMIO registers init value to 0
    b4d5c2ccf1 hw/riscv: Fixed start address error for payload mode (#13)
    127a5b65b7 ae350: Remove platform-related names (#10)
    33cd8ab94d hw/riscv: Dynamic setup start_addr from elf header (#8)
    7a73c161cd ae350: Block user from setting AE350 with over 2GB memory.
    2ab516fcef AE350: Add LCD,GPIO,SND,DMAD as unimplemented device.
    76a60010ce AE350: Add SMU as unimplemented device
    51b93651c3 AE350: Add SMC,SPI,NOR as unimplemented device
    8de0b0d3f9 ae350: Initialize L2C memory region with 0xfffffff
    db3920e771 AE350: Refine AE350 memory map table
    d754de0239 Andes AE350 RISC-V Machine

Signed-off-by: Dylan Jhong <dylan@andestech.com>
Signed-off-by: Ruinland ChuanTzu Tsai <ruinland@andestech.com>
---
